  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>摩天大樓城市（湖城）</strong></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>地圖從零開始透過地形改造創建，由三座風格各異的大型城市組成。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>您可以探索遍佈房屋與摩天大樓的廣闊區域。</span><span>部分建築已裝潢完成，其他仍在建設中。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>每座城市皆以獨特風格打造，具備不同元素，但它們彼此相連。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>外部裝潢旨在與周圍建築相輔相成。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>如果您喜歡我的作品，可透過我的<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Patreon帳號</strong></span>贊助我：<a href=\"patreon.com/Minecreator_666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">patreon.com/Minecreator_666</a></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">地圖：</span></strong></em></span></h1><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67436de3-3fec-4a02-848f-dd391533d88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f2eca539-8802-49bf-ad6c-8389410004a3.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6c29096f-2e8a-457b-ab66-c3943ea39c12.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3bb0e978-bbbc-44f4-98f8-c21ec1d7b52f.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3fc62c98-5e95-4b6b-ab7d-ec1ff807e922.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_145d6c4f-783b-4739-a40a-6fdd282ce60e.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_df681258-cbb8-475e-a23e-d60af951ea05.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_33be2cae-6aa7-4ce1-845c-efac9089eaed.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">更新內容：</span></strong></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>下次更新將全面翻新地形與室內設計。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>團隊也正致力於打造地城與興趣點，以提供更佳遊戲體驗。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>希望您喜歡，也期待聆聽您的意見。</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span>冒險即將展開！</span></strong></em></span></h3>",
